<title>HONG KONG: HK's Lee &amp; Man seen in HK$205 mln IPO - sources.</title>
<headline>HK's Lee &amp; Man seen in HK$205 mln IPO - sources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handbags and paper products maker Lee &amp; Man Holdings Ltd is expected to issue 205 million shares at HK$1.00 per share in an initial public offering (IPO) in Hong Kong, sources said.</p>
<p>Amsteel Corporate Finance (H.K.) Ltd is expected to be the sponsor of the issue, they said.</p>
<p>Sources said no further details were immediately available. Lee &amp; Man, which also manufacture audio cassette products, is expected to hold a company presentation on Tuesday, they said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
